 1092: /****************************************************************************
 1093:  * Name: esp_mipi_dsi_hw_init
 1094:  *
 1095:  * Description:
 1096:  *   Clock/reset enable and HAL/PHY bring-up (ESP-IDF esp_lcd_new_dsi_bus
 1097:  *   sequence adapted for NuttX). Leaves the host in command mode with LP
 1098:  *   transfers enabled.
